@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Game Suggestion Guide";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    Welcome to BucStop! Have a great idea for a game you’d love to see on our site? 
    You can easily share your idea with us by downloading and filling out a short text file, 
    then submitting it through our form. This helps us understand what types of games our users want to play!
</p>

<hr>

<h2>Game Suggestion Requirements</h2>

<p>Before submitting a suggestion, please make sure it follows our community standards:</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Game Name:</strong> Must be under 50 characters and free of offensive language.</li>
    <li><strong>Content:</strong> Must not contain or promote offensive, violent, or illegal material.</li>
    <li><strong>Concept:</strong> Should be creative, fun, and appropriate for a general audience.</li>
    <li><strong>Optional Implementation:</strong> If you have JavaScript experience, you may include an optional code idea or concept sketch.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>How to Submit a Game Idea</h2>

<ol>
    <li><strong>Download the Template:</strong> Click the button below to download the official <em>Game Suggestion Form</em>.</li>
    <li><strong>Fill It Out:</strong> Open the text file and fill in your game’s name, description, and optional JavaScript implementation ideas.</li>
    <li><strong>Submit It:</strong> Upload your completed text file using our submission form on this page.</li>
</ol>

<p>
    <a href="/Game_Suggestion_Form.txt" download class="btn btn-primary">
        📄 Download Game Suggestion Form
    </a>
</p>

<hr>

<h2>Submission Form</h2>

<form asp-controller="Games" asp-action="SubmitSuggestion" enctype="multipart/form-data" method="post">
    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="username">Your Name (optional):</label>
        <input 
            type="text" 
            id="username" 
            name="username" 
            class="form-control" 
            placeholder="Anonymous" />
    </div>

    <div class="form-group mt-3">
        <label for="file">Upload your filled-out form (.txt only):</label>
        <input 
            type="file" 
            id="file" 
            name="file" 
            class="form-control" 
            accept=".txt" 
            required />
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success mt-3">
        Submit Suggestion
    </button>
</form>

<hr>

<h2>About the Suggestion Form</h2>

<p>The downloadable file includes the following fields:</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Game Name:</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Description:</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Optional JavaScript Implementation:</strong></li>
</ul>

<p>
    Thank you for helping shape the future of BucStop! 
    We review all submissions and may reach out if your idea is selected for development.
</p>
